<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #fff;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #333;
      font-size: 24px;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #666;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    a {
      color: #3498db;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #3498db;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 16px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Sorry to See You Go</h1>
    <p>
      Hello {{fullname}},
    </p>
    <p>
      We're sorry to see you go and would like to thank you for using our platform. Your records have been successfully deleted from our system.
    </p>
    <p>
      We value your feedback and would greatly appreciate it if you could take a few moments to fill out our survey. This will help us understand your reasons for leaving and allow us to improve our services in the future.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="{{survey_link}}" class="button">Take the Survey</a>
    </p>
    <p>
      If you have any questions or concerns, please feel free to contact our support team. We're always here to help.
    </p>
    <p>
      Best regards,<br>
      The {{company_name}} Team
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
